\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]Cyclobutanone\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]BrCH2CHO\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]CF3CO2H\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]CH3OBr\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]Criegee\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]HCFC\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\
HNO4\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]HPALD\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],and \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]CH4\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].\
\>", "Text",
